.env
.env.local
node_modules/
out/

# Operator settings written by the admin page. Runtime state, not source: it is
# per-booth, it changes while the event is running, and committing it would let one
# machine's edits overwrite another's. DEFAULTS in server/settings.mjs is the
# tested baseline every booth starts from.
data/
dist/
__pycache__/
.next/
*.log

# Deployment runbooks. They name the hosts, paths and ports of a specific stand —
# this repository is public, and none of that belongs in it. They are also written
# per event and go stale between them, so a copy in git is a copy someone follows
# after it stopped being true. Keep them alongside the booth, not in the source.
DEPLOYMENT.md
DEPLOYMENT_*.md
